      "displayName": "Chris Wilper",
      "self": "https://fedora-repository.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/user?accountId=557058%3Ae25d94d0-bd50-4c2c-906c-14cdf85801fb",
      "timeZone": "America/Halifax"
     },
     "body": "<p>As this code hasn't got much attention in a long time, it may be time for a complete rewrite.  The original purpose was to show how one could write a java client to consume Fedora's SOAP apis.</p>\n\n<p>As Kai pointed out, a similar thing would be useful for the REST api as well.</p>\n\n<p>Another thing to consider: It may make sense to put this under fcrepo-client somewhere, as a distinct project.  Question: If \n    <span class=\"jira-issue-macro resolved\" data-jira-key=\"FCREPO-603\" >\n                <a href=\"https://fedora-repository.atlassian.net/browse/FCREPO-603\" class=\"jira-issue-macro-key issue-link\"  title=\"Standalone, reusable, Java client library for Fedora\" >\n            <img class=\"icon\" src=\"https://fedora-repository.atlassian.net/rest/api/2/universal_avatar/view/type/issuetype/avatar/10315?size=medium\" />\n            FCREPO-603\n        </a>\n                                                    <span class=\"aui-lozenge aui-lozenge-subtle aui-lozenge-success jira-macro-single-issue-export-pdf\">Closed</span>\n            </span>\n (a standalone, reusable Java client library for Fedora) were done right, would a \"demo client\" still be useful?  Or perhaps this could be recast as demo code that used \n    <span class=\"jira-issue-macro resolved\" data-jira-key=\"FCREPO-603\" >\n                <a href=\"https://fedora-repository.atlassian.net/browse/FCREPO-603\" class=\"jira-issue-macro-key issue-link\"  title=\"Standalone, reusable, Java client library for Fedora\" >\n            <img class=\"icon\" src=\"https://fedora-repository.atlassian.net/rest/api/2/universal_avatar/view/type/issuetype/avatar/10315?size=medium\" />\n            FCREPO-603\n        </a>\n                                                    <span class=\"aui-lozenge aui-lozenge-subtle aui-lozenge-success jira-macro-single-issue-export-pdf\">Closed</span>\n            </span>\n?</p>",
     "created": "16/Dec/09 2:24 PM",
     "id": "11171",
     "jsdPublic": true,
     "self": "https://fedora-repository.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/issue/10586/comment/11171",
